// E0931: `!` refuses only an auto-derived trait or family, and `Encode` and
// `Decode` are derived through `#Codable`. A type that writes its codecs by
// hand refuses the derive with `#!Codable`; one that derives a single
// direction writes `#Codable(only: .Decode)` or `#Codable(only: .Encode)`.
#!Encode
Secret: struct { bytes: [U8] }

run: fn() {}
